      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "二人陷入沉默，只有风声仍在呼啸。\r\n若是称这段时间为“刹那”的话，实在是太过漫\r\n长了--",
      "source_fingerprint": "c34088d85cfa6677f8e5f9900b46e4e9f32225f5e93b12b9c9f8682e9da9e022",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
