      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……真是耀眼啊。\r\n就好像它绝不容许他人直视它的光辉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98204b626b4c57a752c18656a6d279a9c5de3c6027798ac4c8600bdd1390264c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
